      { q: "How does heavy snow load change beam sizing in colder states?", a: "The IRC tables referenced here assume the standard residential live load. Regions with heavier ground snow loads often need an engineer's adjustment on top of the base table, so check local amendments before finalising beam size if you're building somewhere with significant snow accumulation." }
