    title: "Deck Board Spacing: What Gap Should You Leave?",
    description: "Standard 3/16 inch gap between deck boards allows drainage and prevents cupping. Here's how to set the right spacing for wood vs composite decking.",
    keyword: "deck board spacing",
    date: "2026-06-20",
